  "reasoning": "The defendants, acting as company executives, fabricated investment projects, forged bank documents, and misrepresented the legality and funding of a construction project. They induced multiple parties to sign construction contracts and then collected deposits, guarantee money, and other fees under false pretenses, with the intent of illegal possession of the victims' property. This conduct fits the legal definition of contract fraud (合同诈骗), where the perpetrator uses false statements to induce another to enter a contract and obtain property. No elements of theft, robbery, or illegal hunting are present. Therefore the appropriate charge is 合同诈骗.",
